      <Comment source="THE-ARABIDOPSIS-INFORMATION-RESOURCE, dreher">At least four sequential linear unphosphorylated maltose residues should be exposed at the end of the amylopectin chain in order for this class of compounds to serve as a substrate for a &amp;beta;-amylase |CITS: [20192737][19141707]|.</Comment>
